# Sin Hunting (windurst 72, RNG AF1): Perih Vashai, Kapeh Myohrye, Muhk Johldy (Windurst Woods), Perchond (Ranguemont
# Pass; the first of the name, the second is cutscene-only), Alexius and the qm2 (Jugner Forest). A level-40 RNG, The
# Fanged One completed by GM (its offer 351 would beat 523; its mustZone clear, so its 358 stays out). No era module
# (RESTRICT_CONTENT default): the qm2 answers at any moon (day 8000 is not a full moon). Available: a bone chip traded to
# Perih Vashai (no quest trade handler; his script's trade wants the Old Earring at fireAndBrimstone 5: nothing); 523
# option 1 (nothing), option 0 (begun, the Chieftainness's Twinstone Earring). Prog 0: Perih Vashai 524; Kapeh Myohrye
# 526, Muhk Johldy 525. Perchond: the glittersand at Prog 0 (nil); 3 option 1 (nothing), option 0 (Prog 1); 4; a chip,
# the glittersand with a chip (not tradeMatches): nil; the glittersand alone: 5, option 1 (nothing, kept), option 0 (the
# trade taken, Perchond's Envelope, Prog 2); 6. The qm2 at Prog 2: nil. Alexius 10 option 1 (nothing), option 0 (Prog
# 3); 11. Perchond at Prog 3: 6. The qm2 13 option 1 (nothing), option 0 (Prog 4); the qm2 and Alexius at Prog 4: nil.
# Perchond at Prog 4: nil (his default 2). Perih Vashai 527 with a full bag (nothing), 527: completed (fame 20, the
# Sniping Bow; both key items taken). Completed: Kapeh Myohrye 530, Muhk Johldy 529 (replaceDefault); Perih Vashai: no
# section: his default 338 first (the lookup's turn), then his script: Sin Hunting completed, Fire and Brimstone
# available, level 40 < AF2_QUEST_LEVEL: 528.
lists WindurstWoods/Perih_Vashai/onTrigger WindurstWoods/Kapeh_Myohrye/onTrigger WindurstWoods/Muhk_Johldy/onTrigger WindurstWoods/onEventFinish/523 WindurstWoods/onEventFinish/527 RanguemontPass/Perchond/onTrigger RanguemontPass/Perchond/onTrade RanguemontPass/onEventFinish/3 RanguemontPass/onEventFinish/5 JugnerForest/Alexius/onTrigger JugnerForest/qm2/onTrigger JugnerForest/onEventFinish/10 JugnerForest/onEventFinish/13
char zone=WindurstWoods pos=119.5,-3.7,90.45 job=RNG lvl=40
quest Windurst.TheFangedOne completed
item BoneChip
item PinchOfGlittersand
login
trade Perih_Vashai BoneChip x1                # available, the check holds: no quest trade handler; his script: nothing
trigger Perih_Vashai                          # RNG, level 40: 523
finish option=1                               # not 0: nothing
trigger Perih_Vashai                          # 523
finish option=0                               # begun; the Chieftainness's Twinstone Earring
trigger Perih_Vashai                          # Prog 0: 524
finish
trigger Kapeh_Myohrye                         # 526
finish
trigger Muhk_Johldy                           # 525
finish
warp -180.8,5,-164.9 RanguemontPass
trade Perchond PinchOfGlittersand x1          # Prog 0: nil
trigger Perchond                              # Prog 0: 3 (0, Pinch of Glittersand)
finish option=1                               # nothing
trigger Perchond                              # 3
finish option=0                               # Prog 1
trigger Perchond                              # Prog 1: 4 (0, Pinch of Glittersand)
finish
trade Perchond BoneChip x1                    # not the glittersand: nil
trade Perchond PinchOfGlittersand x1 BoneChip x1  # with an extra (tradeMatches is exact): nil
trade Perchond PinchOfGlittersand x1          # Prog 1, the glittersand alone: 5
finish option=1                               # nothing; the glittersand kept
trade Perchond PinchOfGlittersand x1          # 5
finish option=0                               # the trade taken; Perchond's Envelope; Prog 2
trigger Perchond                              # Prog 2: 6
finish
warp -8.9,-1,313.8 JugnerForest
trigger qm2                                   # Prog 2: nil
warp 101.9,5.4,386 JugnerForest
trigger Alexius                               # Prog 2: 10
finish option=1                               # nothing
trigger Alexius                               # 10
finish option=0                               # Prog 3
trigger Alexius                               # Prog 3: 11
finish
warp -180.8,5,-164.9 RanguemontPass
trigger Perchond                              # Prog 3: 6
finish
warp -8.9,-1,313.8 JugnerForest
trigger qm2                                   # Prog 3: 13 (0, Pinch of Glittersand)
finish option=1                               # nothing
trigger qm2                                   # 13
finish option=0                               # Prog 4
trigger qm2                                   # Prog 4: nil
warp 101.9,5.4,386 JugnerForest
trigger Alexius                               # Prog 4: nil
warp -180.8,5,-164.9 RanguemontPass
trigger Perchond                              # Prog 4: nil; his default 2
finish
warp 119.5,-3.7,90.45 WindurstWoods
trigger Perih_Vashai                          # Prog 4: 527
fill-inventory
finish                                        # the bow does not fit: complete fails: nothing
free-inventory
trigger Perih_Vashai                          # 527
finish                                        # completed: fame 20, the Sniping Bow; both key items taken
trigger Kapeh_Myohrye                         # completed: 530 (replaceDefault)
finish
trigger Muhk_Johldy                           # completed: 529 (replaceDefault)
finish
trigger Perih_Vashai                          # no section: his default 338 (the lookup's turn: 527 left UseFallback 0)
finish
trigger Perih_Vashai                          # his script's turn: 528 (Fire and Brimstone available, level 40 < 50)
finish
